              "text": "All digital transactions should be slow"
            },
            {
              "key": "B",
              "text": "Carefully designed pauses can improve digital decisions"
            },
            {
              "key": "C",
              "text": "Confirmation screens prevent access"
            },
            {
              "key": "D",
              "text": "Online articles are unreliable"
